      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, setting this to true should not cause multiple `_factory.cpp`. Setting this to true will make some `optional` `_factory` targets available (the target will be non-empty) but nothing will depend on it and drag it into the build. In the gn build it\u0027s the `fontmgr_factory` target which is depended on by other targets, and it depends on whatever target `skia_fontmgr_factory` is set to.\n\nIn fact, I\u0027m still not sure why this change, this was correct. The issue is that `canvaskit_bindings.cpp` blindly always uses `SkFontMgr_New_Custom_Data` instead of `SkFontMgr_New_Custom_Empty` when in this case. Also, fixing that means you don\u0027t need the rest of this change.",
